#: ../../../../xonsh/procs/specs.py:docstring of
#: xonsh.procs.specs.cmds_to_specs:5
msgid ""
"``in_boolop`` is propagated from the parser; it is True when the whole "
"pipeline is a direct operand of a ``&&``/``||`` chain.  Each spec gets the "
"flag stored on it so downstream code (e.g. ``CommandPipeline``, "
"``_raise_subproc_error``) can decide whether to short-circuit on returncode "
"or raise."
msgstr ""

