#: xonsh.procs.specs.get_script_subproc_command:2
msgid ""
"Given the name of a script outside the path, returns a list representing an "
"appropriate subprocess command to execute the script or None if the argument "
"is not readable or not a script. Raises PermissionError if the script is not "
"executable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../xonsh/procs/specs.py:docstring of
#: xonsh.procs.specs.is_app_execution_alias:2
